-- 035_proper_case_seeds.sql
--
-- Website text is now stored as staff type it; only residents' own
-- information stays in ALL CAPS. The texts seeded by migrations 031-033
-- (built-in service cards, the two national hotlines, the officials'
-- checklist and the advisory templates) were seeded in capitals: this puts
-- them in proper case. Each row is changed only while it still holds the
-- exact seeded text, so anything staff edited is left alone.
-- Safe to re-run.

